WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.000
Make your school day clearer with SMPIS. Here’s your quick portal setup.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Visit smpis.digital/signup. Enter your school name, choose a unique portal address, and create an administrator account.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Select Free for the 30-day trial. Add your academic year and school dates, then create the portal.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Open Administration, choose Classes, and add the classes you run. Check the current term.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Create individual teacher accounts, choose each person’s role, and assign teachers to classes. Add your student records, too.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Set term fees. Your team can record attendance and track learning progress in the same workspace.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Ready to get started? Sign up for your free 30-day trial at smpis.digital/signup. No card required, and no automatic charge when the trial ends.
